F. FLOW HISTORY — WHAT WAS TROUBLESHOOTED

Major issue cluster

The biggest instability in the original design was:
	•	new client vs old client
	•	folder missing vs folder already exists
	•	path differences between SharePoint actions
	•	old-client Create file failures

Real issues that were encountered and partially/fully fixed
	1.	Period mismatch
	•	JIMMY T. vs JIMMY T
	•	fixed by input cleanup and safe folder name logic
	2.	Folder-path differences
	•	different SharePoint actions expected different path formats
	•	heavily tested
	3.	Link-writing issues
	•	links were being built manually at one point
	•	better pattern was to use metadata-driven “Link to item”
	4.	Branching/routing issues
	•	Get folder metadata using path
	•	Create new folder
	•	Get file content
	•	Run-after logic needed repeated correction

Important compose step introduced

A flow step called:
	•	Compose - Safe Folder Name

Used this expression:

replace(outputs('Compose_-_Folder_Name'),'.','')

This was kept as a flow-level safety net.

