J. UPDATED ARCHITECTURAL DECISION

New design direction

Split the system into two separate automations/processes:

1. Client creation system
Handles:
	•	creating a new client in the Clients list
	•	normalizing first name / last initial
	•	generating display name
	•	creating the client folder in Clinical Documents

2. Activity Log system
Handles:
	•	selecting an existing client only
	•	generating SOAP / Conceptualization docs
	•	saving them into the already-existing client folder
	•	writing links back to Activity Log
	•	optional Excel logging

Why this change

Because it removes the hardest unstable branch:
	•	new client vs old client
	•	folder missing vs folder existing

from the Activity Log flow.

New intended assumption

By the time an Activity Log row is created:
	•	the client already exists
	•	the client folder already exists

That should make the Activity Log automation much simpler and more reliable.

